  "title": "Charter to Hold Webcast to Discuss Second Quarter 2026 Financial and Operating Results",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., June 29, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Charter Communications, Inc. (NASDAQ: CHTR) (the \"Company\" or \"Charter\") will host a webcast on Friday, July 24, 2026 at 8:00 a.m. Eastern Time (ET) to discuss financial and operating results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026.",
